[[File:Redemption overhead.png|left]]
'''Redemption''' is a prayer unlocked at level 49 [[Prayer]]. When Redemption is active, upon being hit to less than 10% of [[Hitpoints]] remaining (e.g. 9 or below at level 99 Hitpoints), or upon taking any hits (including 0 damage) when at less than 10% health, Redemption will drain the player's [[prayer points]] to zero and heal the player for 25% of their Prayer level rounded down, regardless of remaining prayer points. Note that Redemption will '''not''' prevent lethal damage.

As Redemption is an [[Overheads|overhead prayer]] depicting a heart, players often use it in community events such as maxing and drop parties to show support.

== Healing ==
The amount of Hitpoints healed is based on a player's base prayer level. The formula is  <math display="inline">\lfloor PrayerLevel \times \frac{1}{4} \rfloor</math>.
